{"ticker":"HFCL","symbol":"HFCL","instrumentId":3022459,"name":"Hfcl","industry":"NSE-Computer-Networking","about":"HFCL Ltd. is a leading technology company, specializing in providing end-to-end digital network solutions for telecom, defence, and enterprise customers worldwide. HFCL’s offerings include advanced optical fiber solutions, customizable telecom products, and passive networking components designed for high-speed, secure voice and data transmission. The company’s in-house and collaborative R&D teams drive innovation, creating products like 5G Radio Access Networks, WiFi systems, and unlicensed band radios. HFCL operates manufacturing plants in Hyderabad, Goa, and Chennai, serving clients in India, Europe, Asia Pacific, the Middle East, Africa, and the USA. HFCL is committed to delivering sustainable and cutting-edge digital network solutions.","website":"www.hfcl.com","location":"Solan, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:25:56.105Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":194.44,"changePct":-1.549367088607596,"week52High":271.9,"week52Low":60.95},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹29,761 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹7,492 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"1,102,033,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"253"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"422,740,751"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.10%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"6.08"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"8.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.45"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.33"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-14%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"33.87"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"30–435"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"6.4%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"-2.47"},{"label":"Volume","value":"7,821,308"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"7,776,297"},{"label":"Master score","value":"74"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"69"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"95"},{"label":"Group ra